  {"content":"Earlier in this conversation (context, not requests for you):\n\nUser:\nWhat was added?\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 10.\n\nUser:\nSummarize everything.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 12.\n\nUser:\nOne more detail: the alarm code is 4512.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 14.\n\nUser:\nswitch to Nova\n\nNova agent:\nNova here.\n\nUser:\nAnything new?\n\nNova agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nNova tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nNova agent:\nReply 16.\n\nUser:\nswitch to Scout","role":"user"}
  {"content":"Scout here.","role":"assistant"}
  {"content":"User:\nAnd now?\n\n[Host conversation context: the current responder is Scout. Give only Scout's next reply in this existing group chat. Do not write another participant's lines or repeat speaker labels.]\n\n[Current request: respond to the human input in this turn as Scout. If it greets you, greet the speaker; do not answer an earlier question or resume an older task. Other personas' requests and answers are context, not assignments for you. Refer to earlier findings when this input asks about them. Give only your own reply, without another speaker's lines.]","role":"user"}
